{
  "description": "Reset (drop the mod's own lines for a command, so the entity has what it inherits again) on every type: selected vanilla entities go back to the game's value (unit hp, weapon attack, armor resource cost, item level, spell research level, site gold: the game's site states none, a nation's added recruit, a game event's rarity); copies go back to the copied value (a unit's morale, a weapon's damage); a mod band's xp goes (nothing to inherit).",
